  "id": "cheese-steak-pizza",
  "name": "Cheese Steak Pizza",
  "subtitle": "Thin-sliced beef, sautéed vegetables, and melted cheese on pizza dough.",
  "description": "A hearty pizza topped with tender sirloin, mushrooms, onion, bell pepper, and two layers of melted cheese.",
